      "grounds": "All three observations regarding the figure's appearance describe soft, flowing forms rather than sharp edges. Observation img-k7-o0 notes 'deep, flowing folds that cascade' and a texture suggesting 'soft, pliable cloth gathered... falling into gentle curves.' Observation img-k7-o1 describes hair as having 'distinct, rolled locks' with 'cylindrical shape,' and observation img-k7-o2 describes eyelids creating a 'smooth, rounded contour.' The overall visual impression is explicitly one of 'softness and fluidity,' contradicting the hypothesis of sharp, blunt edges."
